14. Hypotheses
H1
Selective claim decomposition will improve unsupported-claim F1 compared to sentence-level verification.
H2
Selective claim decomposition will achieve similar claim-level F1 to full decomposition while using fewer LLM calls.
H3
Hybrid evidence retrieval will improve claim verification compared to using the full retrieved context.
H4
Claim-level risk aggregation will produce better answer-level hallucination detection than a whole-answer judge or scalar faithfulness score.
